[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7021.51, "timestamp": "01:57:01", "text": "是的，我的意思是，自从……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7026.39, "timestamp": "01:57:06", "text": "最初我们喜欢的是 2020 年、2021 年，现在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7029.109, "timestamp": "01:57:09", "text": "变化很大。现在那里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7031.669, "timestamp": "01:57:11", "text": "就是那些只露脸的 YouTuber"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7035.27, "timestamp": "01:57:15", "text": "还有推特上的所有内容，呃……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7038.629, "timestamp": "01:57:18", "text": "更多的是侧面。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7040.709, "timestamp": "01:57:20", "text": "说实话，我知道有些油管博主只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7042.31, "timestamp": "01:57:22", "text": "他们露面了，就像他们在直播一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7044.79, "timestamp": "01:57:24", "text": "V 就像一台摄像机，然后就说“油管主播”吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7047.83, "timestamp": "01:57:27", "text": "然后说：“哦，我的模型快要启动了。”我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7050.39, "timestamp": "01:57:30", "text": "当时就想，“好吧，这就是最新的新东西了。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7052.43, "timestamp": "01:57:32", "text": "“大概是趋势吧。” 我想。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7055.589, "timestamp": "01:57:35", "text": "是的，我记得看过。我的天啊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7059.51, "timestamp": "01:57:39", "text": "确实有人做过这件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7061.669, "timestamp": "01:57:41", "text": "VTuber 在直播时使用标签。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7064.39, "timestamp": "01:57:44", "text": "是的。 VTuber小镇有什么新变化？我，我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7067.75, "timestamp": "01:57:47", "text": "你知道，我跟他们格格不入。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7069.35, "timestamp": "01:57:49", "text": "这。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7072.229, "timestamp": "01:57:52", "text": "嗯，其中一项新内容将是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7073.91, "timestamp": "01:57:53", "text": "当然，这里面也少不了各种戏剧性事件。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7077.75, "timestamp": "01:57:57", "text": "这是内部情况之一。"}]